        "text": "Page: Archie (comic book). Sentence: Archie (also known as Archie Comics) is an ongoing comic book series featuring the Archie Comics character Archie Andrews.\nPage: Archie Andrews. Sentence: Archie Andrews, created in 1941 by publisher John L. Goldwater and artist Bob Montana in collaboration with writer Vic Bloom, is the main character in an American comic book series published by Archie Comics, as well as the long-running \"Archie Andrews\" radio series, a syndicated comic strip, \"The Archie Show\", and \"Archie's Weird Mysteries\".\nPage: Fiona Staples. Sentence: Fiona Staples is a Canadian comic book artist known for her work on books such as \"North 40\", \"DV8: Gods and Monsters\", \"T.H.U.N.D.E.R. Agents\", \"Archie\", and \"Saga\".",
